config RING_MOTOR_LOGIC
	bool "Ring motor: patterns, replace rule, charge (pure part, no kernel call)"
	help
	  The seven vibration patterns, the rule which pattern may replace which, the Vibration setting's filter and the
	  charge per pulse (design/firmware.md section 3.1). Stdint and stdbool only.

config RING_MOTOR
	bool "Ring motor: the pattern player (thin part, reaches hardware only through ring_rhw)"
	depends on RING_RHW
	select RING_MOTOR_LOGIC
	help
	  The k_timer that plays a pattern on the MOTOR pin: one high per on segment, no PWM (design/firmware.md
	  section 3.1).
